  - speakerName: 'Jewel:'
    line: "\"Got an old set collectin\u2019 rust back there\u2014nothing fancy. Seals
      ain\u2019t great, gauges are twitchy, and she smells like brine and regret.
      But she should be good for a short dive or two... just don\u2019t go stayin\u2019
      down too long, and definitely don\u2019t go deep.\u201D"
    choices: []
    completeQuest: 0
    questToComplete: 0
    startQuest: 0
    questToStart: 0
    requiresItem: 0
    requiredItemName: 
    requiredItemAmount: 0
    requiresQuest: 0
    requiredQuestID: 0
    questMustBeCompleted: 0
  - speakerName: 'Jewel:'
    line: "\"Don\u2019t wanna be left wonderin\u2019 if I sent you off to drown.
      Tell you what\u2014if you find any scrap while you\u2019re down there, bring
      it back my way. I might be able to patch it up a bit better. Won\u2019t be
      free, though! A girl\u2019s still gotta eat.\""
    choices: []
    completeQuest: 1
    questToComplete: 6
    startQuest: 0
    questToStart: 0
    requiresItem: 0
    requiredItemName: 
    requiredItemAmount: 0
    requiresQuest: 0
    requiredQuestID: 0
    questMustBeCompleted: 0
  - speakerName: 'Player:'
    line: "\"Thanks, Jewel. I\u2019ll be careful.\""
    choices: []
    completeQuest: 0
    questToComplete: 0
    startQuest: 0
    questToStart: 0
    requiresItem: 0
    requiredItemName: 
